        "hypothesisUnderTest": "A pre-mechanical harmonic/modal geometry may be hierarchically prior to electromagnetic/visible-color realization. Established physics must first determine which transitions are already lawful and which claims remain unsupported.",
        "sourceNoveltyLimits": [
          "Determine whether frozen SUN relations select a specific operator geometry rather than merely generic spectral geometry.",
          "Determine whether SUN predicts a lawful G1->G2 transition rule rather than borrowing a known parametric mechanism post hoc.",
          "Test whether the old sound/color residuals disappear at the correct layer (spectrum, tristimulus, opponent representation) or persist.",
          "Test whether a primordial hierarchy predicts any quantitative quantity not already forced by QFT or wave mechanics.",
          "Define exactly what 'infra/ultra' means at each layer: outside observer band, outside carrier band, or ancestral/descendant register.",
